{"3154330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bermuda", "steam_appid": 3154330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Bermuda</i> — where the sea is strange and the sailors stranger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of your ragtag crew and navigate a mysterious patch of ocean where physics bend, time twists, and nothing stays the same. <i>Bermuda</i> is a <strong>pause-based strategy game</strong> with <strong>roguelite elements</strong>, <strong>crew management</strong>, and <strong>physics-driven combat</strong> — all set against a backdrop of modern pirate warfare in a surreal, cartoonish world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your ship from a bird's-eye view and issue precise orders to your sailors during pauses. Each crew member has their own stats, gear, and personality. Some fire fast, some shoot straight — all are up to you to command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the ever-shifting Bermuda Triangle, <strong>visibility is limited</strong> and danger comes from everywhere — rival pirate factions, supernatural events, strange anomalies, and the sea itself. Your only hope: adapt, scavenge, and survive long enough to reach your next upgrade.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Bermuda</i> — where the sea is strange and the sailors stranger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of your ragtag crew and navigate a mysterious patch of ocean where physics bend, time twists, and nothing stays the same. <i>Bermuda</i> is a <strong>pause-based strategy game</strong> with <strong>roguelite elements</strong>, <strong>crew management</strong>, and <strong>physics-driven combat</strong> — all set against a backdrop of modern pirate warfare in a surreal, cartoonish world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your ship from a bird's-eye view and issue precise orders to your sailors during pauses. Each crew member has their own stats, gear, a